msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"Hey, Kiryu. I hear you're looking into that Café Alps\r\n"
"murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Huh? How'd you hear about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"Don't underestimate my information network. I know\r\n"
"everything that goes on in this town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Heh. I guess you do. So, do you know anything about the\r\n"
"murder?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"I have the police reports in my database. What do you\r\n"
"want to know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Tell me about the murder weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"The same type of ashtray was found all over the café, but\r\n"
"there was one significant difference between those and\r\n"
"the murder weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Oh, yeah? What was that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "The weaponized ashtray had a chipped edge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Do you know how that happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"The day of the murder, a customer knocked the ashtray\r\n"
"off the table onto the floor, chipping it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Akechi noticed it while he was cleaning up at closing time,\r\n"
"and decided to bring it out to the dumpster to throw it away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"That's when he passed by the locker room and saw his\r\n"
"girlfriend cheating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"So there's no doubt Akechi touched the murder weapon that\r\n"
"day?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"Nope. Normally, the ashtray would've been washed and all\r\n"
"the fingerprints would've disappeared."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"But Akechi noticed that that particular ashtray had been\r\n"
"chipped, so instead of washing it, he decided to throw it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"And by that twist of fate, everyone who touched it that day\r\n"
"still had their prints all over it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"(So <Color:7>all the fingerprints on the murder weapon<Color:Default>\r\n"
"<Color:7>were made the day of the murder<Color:Default>, huh...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Florist's Testimony<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Tell me about the fingerprints on the ashtray."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "These are all the prints taken from the ashtray."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"The prints outlined in red match Akechi's. This is\r\n"
"apparently the evidence that led directly to his arrest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "What about the other fingerprints?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
" Well, one thing's for sure. None of them match the prints\r\n"
"of any of the other employees at Café Alps at the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"They're thought to be from customers who visited the café\r\n"
"that day, probably two or three people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid ""
"Then one of these sets of prints might be from the real\r\n"
"murderer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "It's certainly possible."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"(So <Color:7>the real murderer's prints could be on the<Color:Default> "
"<Color:7>ashtray<Color:Default>, huh...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "You got the <Color:8>Ashtray Fingerprints<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"You should be able to get more information from the people\r\n"
"related to the case. If you haven't talked to all of them\r\n"
"yet, you'd better do that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Thanks. You've been a big help. I owe you one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Ask About the Murder Weapon"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Ask About the Fingerprints"
msgstr ""

